    "problems": "The paper’s concept detector assigns a best-matching concept and its reported interpretability counts are not measures of polysemanticity. Several results are presented only in figures. The paper notes that using minibatches for the regularizer introduces more noise into neuron embeddings. For the adversarial-training discussion, it focuses on one model’s visualizations while stating that observations are consistent across multiple trained models.",
